<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>knaif @VERSION@ is installed</title></head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;">
<p><b>knaif @VERSION@ is installed</b> in /usr/local/knaif.</p>
<p>Open a new Terminal window and try the commands below. If you left "Add knaif to my PATH"
unticked, type <code>/usr/local/knaif/bin/knaif</code> instead of <code>knaif</code>.</p>
<pre>knaif skills list
knaif skills deps
knaif run ffmpeg "compress clip.mp4 for email"</pre>
<p><code>knaif skills deps</code> shows any supporting tool still missing, with the
<code>brew install</code> command for it. If you chose the model download, it runs in its own
Terminal window; if no window opened, or you skipped it, run
<code>knaif models pull @MODEL@</code>. Setup's own log is in
<code>/var/log/install.log</code>.</p>
<p>To uninstall: <code>sudo /usr/local/knaif/uninstall.sh</code> (add <code>--purge</code> to
also remove downloaded models in ~/.knaif).</p>
</body>
</html>
